{"meta":{"id":"tt36064406","type":"series","name":"Coven Academy: El Secreto de las Brujas","description":"Tras llegar a una misteriosa escuela de magia en Nueva Orleans, la adolescente neoyorquina Briar Roberts intenta resolver el misterio sobre el destino de su madre en medio de un creciente conflicto entre brujas y vampiros. Con su aquelarre de jóvenes aprendices de bruja, deberá combatir una amenaza aún más oscura y sobrevivir a los peligros de una escuela secundaria sobrenatural. Y entre tanto caos, nacerá un primer amor prohibido.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d61XSo2lQN18OYQ2HTautxSkSW1.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mGFtH5pUXDd4hSXUfl8HnHlRWJV.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aLeYq4L42atgrJn5fqHI5iRPgCO.png","genres":["Misterio","Drama","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"7.4","trailers":[{"source":"7EGDq4IN-IA","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["Malina Weissman","Malachi Barton","Jordan Leftwich","Ora Duplass","Louis Thresher","Tiffani Thiessen","Devon Sawa"],"director":["Tim Federle"],"writer":[],"links":[{"name":"Malina Weissman","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Malina%20Weissman"},{"name":"Malachi Barton","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Malachi%20Barton"},{"name":"Jordan Leftwich","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jordan%20Leftwich"},{"name":"Ora Duplass","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Ora%20Duplass"},{"name":"Louis Thresher","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Louis%20Thresher"},{"name":"Tiffani Thiessen","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Tiffani%20Thiessen"},{"name":"Devon Sawa","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Devon%20Sawa"},{"name":"Tim Federle","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Tim%20Federle"}],"app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Malina Weissman","character":"Briar Roberts","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and